# Only three things are excluded. Everything else in the project is committed,
# including logs/, data/raw/, new-results/ and the loose CSVs.

# 1.4 GB of installed packages; rebuild with:
#   python3 -m venv venv && ./venv/bin/pip install -r requirements.txt
venv/

# 16 MB of npm packages for the third-party template-engine app; rebuild with:
#   cd thirdparty && npm install
node_modules/

# 177 MB: over GitHub's 100 MB per-file hard limit, so it cannot be pushed.
# Re-download it with the DOI and URL in data/SOURCES.md
# (Mendeley "Large-Scale Annotated Dataset for XSS Attack Detection" v2, CC BY 4.0).
data/raw/mendeley/xss_dataset.csv
